Found by mcp-hub-worker during k62 (2026-11-06), read not run. morbo serves the hub in one process but through a bare Mojo::Server::Daemon: it skips what 'mcp-hub daemon' does around the server (warming fetches, container cleanup on shutdown), and restarts the worker on every watched-file change, orphaning upstreams. Decide: refuse it like hypnotoad (pointing at mcp-hub daemon), or document it as dev-only. Low priority.
